<title>USA: Dal-Tile CFO Carlos Sala resigns.</title>
<headline>Dal-Tile CFO Carlos Sala resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlos Sala has resigned as chief financial officer of ceramic tile maker Dal-Tile International, the company said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sala, who accepted a position as senior vice president and chief financial officer at Abacus Direct Corp, will leave his post May 2, it said.</p>
<p>Richard Sewell will succeed him as Dal-Tile acting CFO.</p>
<p>Dal-Tile, reporting first-quarter earnings of $0.12 a share, versus $0.02 a year ago after a special charge of $0.12, said it foresees improved performance in the 1997 second half.</p>
</text>
